#. Tag: title
#: book_virtualization.xml:66
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "概要"

#. Tag: meta
#: book_virtualization.xml:68
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Explore the basics of enterprise Linux virtualization technologies including "
"KVM, Xen, libvirt management tools, and host server setup"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: book_virtualization.xml:92
#, no-c-format
msgid "Managing virtual machines with &libvirt;"
msgstr "&libvirt; を利用した仮想マシンの管理"

#. Tag: meta
#: book_virtualization.xml:94
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Manage virtual machines with libvirt by configuring hosts, installing "
"guests, administering storage, using virsh or GUI tools, and migrating VMs"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: book_virtualization.xml:125
#, no-c-format
msgid "Hypervisor-independent features"
msgstr "全ハイパーバイザ共通の機能"

#. Tag: meta
#: book_virtualization.xml:127
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Configure hypervisor-independent features like disk cache modes, VM clock "
"settings, libguestfs, software TPM, and crash dumps on Linux servers"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: book_virtualization.xml:149
#, no-c-format
msgid "Managing virtual machines with &xen;"
msgstr "&xen; を利用した仮想マシンの管理"

#. Tag: meta
#: book_virtualization.xml:151
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Manage Xen virtual machines by setting up hosts, configuring networking, "
"handling block devices, and implementing high-availability virtualization"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: book_virtualization.xml:180
#, no-c-format
msgid "Managing virtual machines with &qemu;"
msgstr "&qemu; を利用した仮想マシンの管理"

#. Tag: meta
#: book_virtualization.xml:182
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Manage QEMU virtual machines on SUSE Linux Enterprise by configuring KVM "
"host servers, installing guests, and administering systems with QEMU monitor"
msgstr ""

